# Frontend

**KB:** `knowledge-base/apis/INDEX.md` + module docs for routes you call

## Pages (do not add form/canvas workflow builder unless asked)

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/agents`, `/agents/:slug` | `GET /api/agents` |
| `/workflows`, `/workflows/:id` | CRUD + `POST .../run` |
| `/executions`, `/executions/:id` | `GET /api/executions` |

## Conventions

- Auth: `context/AuthContext.jsx` + `api/client.js` Bearer token
- Poll execution detail while `pending` / `running`
- LangSmith: link from `execution.langsmith.trace_url` or nested field — do not rebuild trace UI
- Agent detail must show: schemas, workflows using, stats, recent runs

## When API changes

Update matching page + `knowledge-base/apis/{module}.md` + check `dependencies.yaml` `ui_*` nodes
